INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY

The following elements are trade secrets and proprietary innovations of the
copyright holder:

  • CPR-based signal generation rules (rule1–rule11) and their backtest-
    calibrated parameter sets.
  • LGBM2c and PPO inference pipeline with India VIX integration.
  • MFE/MAE grid-search calibration methodology for NSE equity markets.
  • High Yield filter logic derived from 4.56 million signal backtests.
  • Three-mode hold-duration calibration (3-day / 1-week / 3-week).
  • Camarilla + CPR confluence scoring framework.

